{"factor_id":"miner_1_20290115_downside_trend_reversal","factor_name":"Downside-risk-adjusted 40-day trend reversal","version":"1.0","calculation":{"expression":"-(close[t-1]/close[t-41]-1) / (downside_std_40 * sqrt(40) + 1e-8), conditional on 20-day positive breadth > 50%","description":"Ranks assets contrarian to their lagged 40-trading-day return, with stronger reversal scores for trends formed with lower downside volatility. The signal is active only when more than half of the tradable universe has positive 20-day returns."},"dependencies":["close","daily_returns"],"parameters":{"trend_lookback":40,"downside_volatility_window":40,"breadth_window":20,"breadth_threshold":0.5,"forward_horizon":10},"validation":{"status":"EFFECTIVE","period":"2025-01-01 to 2029-01-14","timestamp":"2029-01-15T00:00:00Z","metrics":{"ic":0.11372839827019028,"icir":0.5018076459400231,"horizon_days":10,"valid_dates":109,"average_instruments":15.0,"coverage":1.0,"turnover":0.09156378600823044,"hit_ratio":0.706422018867924,"max_abs_library_correlation":null},"regime_notes":"15-instrument cross-asset universe; 2025-2026: reversed IC +0.11227, ICIR +0.42581 (30 dates); 2027-2028: reversed IC +0.11428, ICIR +0.53711 (79 dates). No eligible observations in 2020-2024 because the supplied histories did not produce valid observations under the 40/20-day construction and forward horizon. Small cross-section implies conservative uncertainty interpretation.","signal_artifact":"scripts/miner_1_20290115_downside_trend_signal.csv"},"tags":["reversal","trend","downside-risk","breadth","cross-asset"],"last_validated":"2029-01-15T00:00:00Z"}